g>Therapist intro</strong><br />\nWhispers Through Shattered Glass\n<ul>\n<li>In Terragroup building next to Mechanics locked door, it’s on butchering table seen in quest image.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Mechanic follow up</strong><br />\nVapor Substitute after Bad Habit</li>\n<li><strong>Euphoria storyline</strong><br />\n50 quests in a single linear chain with some side quests</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Unpack the zip and drop the user folder into your SPTarkov root.</p>\n<p>(Use 7Zip <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.7-zip.org/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Here</a>)</p>\n<p>Install demo video credit to Drakia:</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vKRw58b.gif\" alt=\"Demonstration\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-6\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Recommended Mods</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Recommended Mods:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2304/dragon-den-neon-signs\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Dragon Den - Neon Signs</strong></a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1431/dynamic-maps\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Dynamic Maps</strong> (for quest locations)</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1508-kaeno-traderscrolling/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Kaeno Traderscrolling</strong></a></li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-7\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Known Issues</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Not compatible with SPT Realism as is <strong>(i will not make a patch)</strong></li>\n<li>Other than that, none that I know of.</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-8\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li><strong>Welcome to Tarkov</strong> for framework and help</li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/36153/epicrangetime\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">EpicRangeTime</a></strong> for helping me a lot with weapon parts!</li>\n<li><strong>Drakia</strong> for the install video</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-9\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">What is Dragon Den</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Dragon Den</strong> is my twist on Tarkov. It is where cuteness, edgyness, and weirdness collide while staying believable.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Traders with their own quirks and attitude</li>\n<li>Custom items and quests that feel fresh</li>\n<li>Backpacks, armor, facewear and headwear with personality</li>\n<li>Odd creations that should not exist but still fit right in</li>\n</ul>\n<p>No weapons, just everything else that makes Tarkov less boring.</p>\n<p>Want to reach me? Look for #drexiras-dragon-den in <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/WelcomeToTarkov\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Welcome To Tarkov’s Discord</a></p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11", "content_length": null, "downloads": 163, "published_at": "2025-10-01T08:21:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2330/dragon-den-euphoria/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": [{"id": 649, "name": "Virtual's Custom Quest Loader", "slug": "virtuals-custom-quest-loader"}]}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11", "content_length": null, "downloads": 567, "published_at": "2025-10-01T09:46:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2330/dragon-den-euphoria/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null,